<title>ITALY: Italy approves three-yr economic plan - minister.</title>
<headline>Italy approves three-yr economic plan - minister.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian government has approved a three-year economic strategy, known as the DPEF, which aims to set Italy firmly on a path to join European Economic and Monetary Union, Transport Minister Claudio Burlando said.</p>
<p>Burlando spoke to reporters at the end of a two-and-a-half hour cabinet meeting. Rome newsroom +396-6782505</p>
